# Multi-page static wireframe — do not SPA-fallback to /index.html.
# Root index.html is the home page (Cloudflare Pages default).
# Directory indexes (contact/, products/, support/, solutions/, blogs/)
# are served natively. Root *.html stubs already meta-refresh to canonical paths.
# Trailing slash for section folders that have index.html:
/contact /contact/ 302
/products /products/ 302
/support /support/ 302
/solutions /solutions/ 302
/blogs /blogs/ 302
/company/board.html /company/leadership.html 302
/company/research.html /company/manufacturing.html 302
/company/inventory.html /sitemap.html 302
/rd.html /company/manufacturing.html 302
